# Environment Variables & Secrets (CRITICAL)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Python & Virtual Environments
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
*$py.class
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/

# Databases
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3

