**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
npm-debug.log*

# LaTeX Auxiliary Build Files
**/*.aux
**/*.log
**/*.out
**/*.toc
**/*.synctex.gz
**/*.fls
**/*.fdb_latexmk

# System files
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
